  "details": "Thank you for your continued work on the development and maintenance of VRChat.\n\nThere is an issue where the **VRCUiShape pointer stops appearing after using the VRChat camera**.\n\nThis can be reproduced consistently across multiple environments using the following steps:\n\n1. Confirm that the UI pointer is visible as usual\n\n2. Open the VRChat camera\n\n3. Close the camera\n\n4. The `VRCUiShape` pointer no longer appears afterward\n\nThe pointer **temporarily returns when opening the menu**, but the issue reoccurs each time the camera is used, making UI interaction unreliable.\n\nIf possible, I would appreciate it if this behavior could be investigated.\n\nThank you very much.",
